gin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px -12px 0px -15px; padding: 10px 23px 10px 25px; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(245, 245, 245) 53%, rgba(241, 241, 241, 0) 100%); min-width: 5%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">02 项目执行与计划管理</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 5%; height: auto; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">会议详细拆解了从范围界定到进度控制的执行闭环，强调了计划编制的科学性与系统性：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(231, 58, 48); max-width: 100% !important;\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">1. 范围界定与工作分解</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100% !important;\">范围变更控制</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">范围不清是导致项目超支的首要原因。必须明确产品范围（交付物）和工作范围（EPC 内容），严禁无底线承诺，以避免拖期和成本失控。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100% !important;\">WBS 分解原则</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">遵循&ldquo;责任唯一性&rdquo;原则，确保每项任务有且仅有一个责任人；遵循&ldquo;汇总原则&rdquo;，确保下级工作之和等于上级工作；任务之间需明确逻辑关系而非简单顺序。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; line-height: 0; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100047730\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/3-3.png\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); vertical-align: bottom; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important; width: 100%;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(231, 58, 48); max-width: 100% !important;\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">2. 进度计划与时间估算</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100% !important;\">多级计划体系</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">建立 1 级（总体进度/里程碑）、2 级（主进度/资源统筹）、3 级（部门执行）及 4 级（作业明细）的分级计划体系，确保宏观与微观的联动。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100% !important;\">时间估算方法</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">推荐使用&ldquo;三点估算法&rdquo;（最乐观+最悲观+4倍最可能）/6 来应对非标任务的不确定性；随着标准化完善，可过渡到&ldquo;类比估算法&rdquo;。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100% !important;\">关键路径法（CPM）应用</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">针对确定性任务，利用 CPM 计算项目工期；对于大型科研项目，可采用 PERT 技术处理不确定性。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; line-height: 0; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100047727\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/3-4.png\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); vertical-align: bottom; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important; width: 100%;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 5%; height: auto; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 33.85px; flex-flow: column; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 1; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; width: 32px; height: 32px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(234, 71, 61); margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px -12px 0px -15px; padding: 10px 23px 10px 25px; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(245, 245, 245) 53%, rgba(241, 241, 241, 0) 100%); min-width: 5%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">03 财务管控与数字化支撑</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 5%; height: auto; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">为解决&ldquo;算不清账&rdquo;的痛点提出了全生命周期的财务管控模型及系统选型建议：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(231, 58, 48); max-width: 100% !important;\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">1.&ldquo;四算合一&rdquo;财务模型</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100% !important;\">全周期成本核算</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">推行&ldquo;概算、预算、核算、决算&rdquo;四算合一管理。概算指导报价，预算控制执行，核算贯穿全过程（含设计、安装、运输等），决算分析盈利。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100% !important;\">项目全成本归集</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">成本核算需覆盖料工费外的设计成本、安装成本、运输成本等，确保项目盈亏清晰，避免&ldquo;大锅饭&rdquo;分摊。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; line-height: 0; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100047731\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/3-5.png\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); vertical-align: bottom; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important; width: 100%;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(231, 58, 48); max-width: 100% !important;\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">2. 一体化系统选型</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100% !important;\">计划驱动 MRP</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">非标制造需采用&ldquo;项目计划驱动 MRP 计划&rdquo;的模式，而非传统的订单驱动，以实现物料与生产的精准联动。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); max-width: 100% !important;\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">系统集成要求</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">避免采购、销售、财务、设计等多系统孤岛，应选择一体化平台，确保业务数据在线，为后续 AI 应用打下基础。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; line-height: 0; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100047729\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/3-6.png\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); vertical-align